                                        (relative bits)

sqrt(x)       1 .. 2                    64.1                         63.2
atan(x)       1e-10 .. 200              64.2                         62.8
cos(x)        0 .. pi/2-(1e-10)         64.4 (x &lt;= pi/4)             62.4
                                        64.1 (x = pi/2-(1e-10))      31.9
sin(x)        1e-10 .. pi/2             64.0                         62.8
